action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P54 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): .refreshable is reachable and each refresh adds two rows.
# GtkBackend floats a Refresh button over the scroll view's top-leading corner since 2026-10-16, as AppKit and WinUI do; edge-overshot (still connected) fires for touch and kinetic scrolling, not for a mouse wheel, and two wheel turns past the top left refreshes at 0.
# Measured from p54-macos-gtk4-final-20261016 (1440x1296, 2x halved, origin=frame): Refresh at (45,53). After this file refreshes must read 2 and the rows reach 10.
# GtkBackend 自 2026-10-16 起在捲動視圖左上角浮一顆 Refresh 按鈕(與 AppKit、WinUI 相同);滑鼠滾輪不會觸發 edge-overshot。
sleep,,,,,,1000000,let P54 render,macos
click,45,53,frame,left,,,"Refresh -- refreshes must become 1 and the rows must reach 8",macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,let the rows rebuild,macos
click,45,53,frame,left,,,"Refresh again -- refreshes must become 2 and the rows must reach 10",macos
sleep,,,,,,800000,settle before the photograph,macos
